# MAE runtime output — rendered artifacts, export packages and test-generated governed records.
# These are derived and/or contain absolute machine paths; the governed record store is regenerated
# by running the suite. Source-of-truth config (brand-truth.json) and labeled synthetic fixtures
# (fixtures/) are intentionally NOT ignored.
storage/
data/*
!data/brand-truth.json
!data/fixtures/
!data/fixtures/**

# ── Canonical production truth records (governed, evidence-backed) ─────────────────────────────
# The blanket `data/*` rule above was written when only synthetic/test-generated records existed
# ("regenerated by running the suite"). Evidence-backed production CRF/MIF are NOT regenerable
# runtime output — they are canonical source data (Git is the ledger: pipeline.md §23/§24,
# data/README.md). Un-ignore ONLY the governed production-truth records; scratch/test-generated
# records, provider output, raw caches and secrets stay ignored.
#
# Canonical system-of-record collection (committed):
!data/customer-reality/
data/customer-reality/*
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-CORD-CARE-*.json
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-SLEEP-*.json
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-FEED-*.json
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-SUPPLY-*.json
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-CORE-*.json
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-MONEY-*.json
!data/customer-reality/CRF-PPL-TRIAGE-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/
data/market-intelligence/*
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-CORD-CARE-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-MONEY-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-SUPPLY-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-FEED-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-SLEEP-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-CORE-*.json
!data/market-intelligence/MIF-PPL-TRIAGE-*.json
#
# `data/_prod-candidates/` is an ingestion STAGING area (workflow input to ingest-crf/mif.ts into the
# collections above), not a store collection — it stays ignored. No duplicate candidate records are
# committed; the persisted production records are the single canonical copy.
data/_prod-candidates/

# ── V06 marketing campaign — canonical pre-approval campaign set ───────────────────────────────
# Every artifact referenced by MASTER-MARKETING-PACK.json MUST be part of the tracked canonical set
# (artifact-closure invariant, mae/services/marketing-pack.js). The pack and the campaign
# collections it references are committed; unrelated CSEC/test-generated records in the same
# collections stay ignored.
!data/MASTER-MARKETING-PACK.json
!data/marketing-angles/
data/marketing-angles/*
!data/marketing-angles/ANG-NS-*.json
!data/asset-families/
data/asset-families/*
!data/asset-families/FAM-NS-*.json
!data/assets/
data/assets/*
!data/assets/AST-NS-*.json
!data/generated/
data/generated/*
!data/generated/GEN-NS-*.json
!data/qa/
data/qa/*
!data/qa/QA-NS-*.json
!data/psets/
data/psets/*
!data/psets/LPS-NS-*.json
!data/design-specs/
data/design-specs/*
!data/design-specs/DES-NS-*.json
!data/visual-groundings/
data/visual-groundings/*
!data/visual-groundings/VG-NS-*.json
!data/campaigns/
data/campaigns/*
!data/campaigns/CAMP-NS-*.json
!data/sequences/
